<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<contentList>
	<content contentuid="h5eed4532gcf0ag4afcgb954gf64de974e61a" version="1">我本该在冰封王座上刻符文。可不是……干这个。</content>
	<content contentuid="hc32c55c7ga72ag4ca0gaa83gd58253c94659" version="1">你说真的？！从梅菲斯塔尔的尖塔把我拖下来，就为了这个？！</content>
	<content contentuid="hf4fb7a42g16bdg47fbgad65g5b764f8b45f7" version="1">契约做了三百年，临了被扔进一场路边斗殴。妙极了。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6e731ee6g3471g4820g91f0gdd32b135f617" version="1">卡尼亚的亲王们都看着呢。别给我丢脸。</content>
	<content contentuid="h9915aed0g3e60g46e3g978egb1c0dd906ddc" version="1">为我的主人，烧！</content>
	<content contentuid="h67491bceg4679g492agacfdgeead5417af5f" version="1">给我倒下，贱民！</content>
	<content contentuid="h0b285db7g11cdg4768gbb2bg2053409eaa15" version="1">奶呢？！出声！</content>
	<content contentuid="hf32137d0g43d8g4c6dga46fgfb57930a97c6" version="1">梅菲斯塔尔的火，收了你！</content>
	<content contentuid="h114298c7g4692g44dag9300gafb74bad7fb1" version="1">法袍！先撕法袍！永远先撕法袍！</content>
	<content contentuid="h559bf8fdg06a4g45f3g8396g85be9f8c9027" version="1">你的灵魂，先赊着！</content>
	<content contentuid="h12e73c3cgb666g43c6g8cb4gf6191a14682a" version="1">可怜。再拉几个过来——我都快睡着了！</content>
	<content contentuid="hcaf71aa5gdf98g451dg9265g6086ff32ba6e" version="1">化为灰烬吧，蠢货！</content>
	<content contentuid="h52f2fbc2g953bg4404ga668gc4594e1ff2d5" version="1">卡尼亚记住你的名字了！</content>
	<content contentuid="h94cddbb4ge39dg485cg8b77g97bccdf84cac" version="1">站好了，炮灰！</content>
	<content contentuid="h04a0763cgf4beg4920ga5afgdab88de950e7" version="1">强化献祭，五点点满，宝贝。回去看攻略。</content>
	<content contentuid="h5237ce3eg89a0g4b8aga3d8g70b37f3108e3" version="1">再打我一下，我就举报到GM那儿。我上面有人。</content>
	<content contentuid="h5c5b69b1gbaaag42bdg8904gd23531131af8" version="1">敢碰我，公会蹲你号，蹲满一个星期。不信就试试。</content>
	<content contentuid="h3e3b0074gba28g4e67gb539g603a61e25947" version="1">奶呢？！……行。一群只会刷伤害的废物。</content>
	<content contentuid="h37809375g4210g467dg9d5dgd61be5c146a3" version="1">延迟。全是延迟。我不可能输给路人团。</content>
	<content contentuid="h5dd8daecgcc44g49c1g8e0dgf4222a958bed" version="1">我在钓鱼。这是四维象棋，你们看不懂。</content>
	<content contentuid="h634b7a31g9978g4682g9582g39a5edff74ee" version="1">开减伤，开——我哪有减伤？！</content>
	<content contentuid="h03d6c297g7b00g44b9gb40eg3647a12bd5c2" version="1">伤害统计骗了我……</content>
	<content contentuid="hbd276497g88f3g4290gaaa4g590d70924ebc" version="1">GG。人举报了。游戏卸了。我挂机了。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6c5dcbaagce27g4cfag894cg7df3f0d20fe3" version="1">削弱……这个吧……</content>
	<content contentuid="h0830e5c2g712cg4a80g98b3gae22f43d286f" version="1">你出手就像猎物。很好。</content>
	<content contentuid="hfa6aa586g98afg4dfdgb7b4g08211e096473" version="1">看着我。别看另一个。送你上路的是我。</content>
	<content contentuid="hbba9ba72g6c8cg4bd6g9327gf411065b69de" version="1">他们就派了这种人来？令人失望。</content>
	<content contentuid="h978ff4ebg6c61g49e6g8843g385c007bb0ee" version="1">外行。虚空吞下的东西，都比你们像样。</content>
	<content contentuid="he07b00b4g30bbg424cgb971g06e31e40d8be" version="1">结界会碎。外行也一样。</content>
	<content contentuid="h009f7606g8f91g4bf3ga4e5g3d6d8be87d15" version="1">站住，法师。别再手脚并用了。</content>
	<content contentuid="h85e07a8eg7160g4024g9f29geb2cccea91f2" version="1">太慢。你从来都这么慢。</content>
	<content contentuid="hdd02f57eg9d89g4561gb881g41be1eaefa2d" version="1">一道划伤。图纳拉斯的刀更深，照样没砍死我。</content>
	<content contentuid="hdf770df1g251ag46d7g86b6g82676105c009" version="1">把力气花在我身上？蠢。方向对了，人还是蠢。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2118ee92g643eg4e3eg8753g4d77e7b2afbf" version="1">还在猎。</content>
	<content contentuid="h0d303256g783eg49b9ga26bg5dd932e369e0" version="1">流亡者……死也是自由的。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb2a79772ga220g431dgb2bfg8629d1f0c12d" version="1">没有哪座王座……下令要我死。</content>
	<content contentuid="hf623ff3cg3b9fg433dga1cagb3a228822158" version="1">够干净了。</content>
	<content contentuid="hfaf2ca67g9e4eg45fegb6e0g59508802ddd9" version="1">对一位女士拔剑，可真是上不了台面。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb7387e0fgf351g4f4aga12agbdb4cd6622db" version="1">看着我。别看我的主人。怎么，怕了？</content>
	<content contentuid="h9bc541c5gf94eg43a1gb3caga41030f032f4" version="1">比你金贵的，我冻过不知多少，心里毫无波澜。</content>
	<content contentuid="h236bfd2fg2f32g40cbg93c0ga94dc26bb3fa" version="1">跪下，要么冻上。对贱民，这话我不说第二遍。</content>
	<content contentuid="h726e28b9g6761g4176ga122g1cd4707d140a" version="1">别动。你连挣扎都这么难看。</content>
	<content contentuid="h697ddbd1g2fa8g4b11gae39gc5857fb80695" version="1">温暖给你，纯属浪费。我收回来。</content>
	<content contentuid="hdcba525dg7b05g41abgaef9gdeaab67d0172" version="1">抖吧，小火苗。你也就这点用处。</content>
	<content contentuid="hd2919357gd694g47aeg9447gdae2d08ee35a" version="1">在冰上划两道，就当自己赢了？真是可笑。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb68b3dd1g4030g4b92ga41ega56906d9886c" version="1">女王你尽管打。你依旧高攀不上。</content>
	<content contentuid="h3ce6927eg6dd4g4ac4gafdegcb517b013139" version="1">我碎过一次。碎我的人，比你强。你不够格。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha1ad738dgac9dg4957g8471g8784a09a0d6d" version="1">我守的人倒了。那我……也自由了。</content>
	<content contentuid="h36b1c2f4g4c20g42a1g8ac7g446599e7a98c" version="1">回到漫长的寒冷里。一如往常。</content>
	<content contentuid="h7d3af1c5gfd92g4e12ga77eg4d6d6c6d721c" version="1">姐姐……我还被绑着……</content>
	<content contentuid="ha4fb9622gc77bg4be1g91c5g8ad284c6c0e1" version="1">看着我，虫子们。别看我身后那具傀儡。看我。</content>
	<content contentuid="hbad0ee0cgff04g4d1dgaa2eg8f5d9199bf72" version="1">你们那点小世界，就养出这种东西？可怜。</content>
	<content contentuid="h2fd61da0gb4b9g4904g8ad1g456bbaf56be6" version="1">我本想叫你逃。可你连逃的力气都没有。</content>
	<content contentuid="he16e5c72g429bg455egbe2egbeffeb2644c6" version="1">我们两个，你都不知该看谁。这就说明问题了。</content>
	<content contentuid="h42b9401bg2793g4216g91fdgdb4ff6ccc865" version="1">感受这股压上来的力。在我眼里，你早已是灰。</content>
	<content contentuid="h352287c2gbd23g4354ga509ge4029d7aa19a" version="1">够了。从这世上消失吧。</content>
	<content contentuid="h370251ecgae40g4385g9ecdg53a5b4ab5e43" version="1">比你强的，我随手就抹掉过。</content>
	<content contentuid="h8a55ef80g821bg4ba0gb95fgd7f9210c34e6" version="1">你刮得动这层金。刮不到金下面的人。</content>
	<content contentuid="h074ac81eg703eg48d3gb1fage3c46a337b58" version="1">跳蚤叮出血了。猎犬还是没发觉。</content>
	<content contentuid="hd97c5b6cga811g4223g8bdcg9efcc01d1b45" version="1">这是他想要的吗？……无所谓了。</content>
	<content contentuid="h1db18747ge078g4a7agafc6g9caf4c56873c" version="1">我什么都跨过去了……还是没找到你。原谅我，儿子。</content>
	<content contentuid="hcbfbe5d3g58feg4c21g9a1cg656caf88f6d4" version="1">连金子……也会尽。</content>
	<content contentuid="hdfc07aeeg7ffbg44cbg901cg5589638e3082" version="1">告诉他……我一直在找……</content>
	<content contentuid="hb0099ab1gc025g44ebg8f81g8d5949c098e5" version="1">别盯着那头大的了。你难道不想……杀掉你自己？</content>
	<content contentuid="hb5071ebfg6461g4d24gbd38g172e307d2823" version="1">别动。说真的，这身皮我穿，比你穿得像样。</content>
	<content contentuid="h88b82d7fg196bg42ddg8d8cg494acf70e5c9" version="1">原主死了，没人会想。信我。我查过。</content>
	<content contentuid="h149ebe7cg69b4g474dgad67g95b25d8e84ce" version="1">模板太差。我会改得比你好。</content>
	<content contentuid="h207d4d6egdeb8g4d27g8621g731c7f692dcd" version="1">你自己的招，总算有人使对了。</content>
	<content contentuid="hf16a85f1g4f34g4bf0g9369g9ce27cbce4ec" version="1">看好了。你这人，本该这么演。</content>
	<content contentuid="h864e7781g5128g46bdg82cfgf9919e745b78" version="1">有意思。穿在我身上，比穿在你身上像样。</content>
	<content contentuid="h0407a22cg80efg40begadd7g1b9b3ddb7fe5" version="1">尽管割。你割的是别人的皮。</content>
	<content contentuid="hbc8b69dbgb11eg458bgaa7aga2eda5062887" version="1">这张脸快磨破了。我还有一千张，都比它好。</content>
	<content contentuid="h27ee94a1gf942g4180g807fg2d795ecdc444" version="1">做这行的，总留一条退路。你呢？</content>
	<content contentuid="h0ca8aa9ag5efag4863g9dc1g4cd13dbd0e7c" version="1">这么多张脸……没有一张是我自己的。</content>
	<content contentuid="h99a267e2ga000g4c28g891agee14befd8d11" version="1">你以为我是谁，就把谁埋了吧。</content>
	<content contentuid="hc54fab0eg1fcfg4bbfgbda5g328cbff5e774" version="1">那张契约……从来……就是空白。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha4df2f8ega81cg413agbd4cgfb2af4677d12" version="1">冲我来。别冲我护着的人。怎么，审判太刺眼？</content>
	<content contentuid="hfa679075gbfd9g4b33ga5beg32df2499561c" version="1">走进光里来。太阳已经看见你有多不够格。</content>
	<content contentuid="h30a2c03dg6b14g4dc8gaa8dg7d9d486d0005" version="1">你配不上自己的影子。人，影子，我一起收。</content>
	<content contentuid="hfd3549fcg9048g48d0g8ae9ga40f75e4c3c9" version="1">跪在黎明里，或者站着烧成灰。不配活着的东西。</content>
	<content contentuid="hdf93b1e3g228cg49d6g98feg7a26448918d6" version="1">不给你留一丝黑。让你无处可钻。</content>
	<content contentuid="hf28d9c78g0c6dg4a4dg859bg951dfe95b3bb" version="1">诸天只护自己人。他们看都看不见你。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha20cd8f3g4db3g4e1fgb79cgc74116e2bb97" version="1">沐浴这光，接受审判。这裁决，你不会喜欢。</content>
	<content contentuid="h82ba7088g78f1g4acdg9e6ag6c6a651b3bdc" version="1">鳞你烧得焦。太阳你灭不掉。</content>
	<content contentuid="h9693ecefgd8efg446agb03fg8c3551d1434b" version="1">打这具躯壳吧。光，你身上从来就没有。</content>
	<content contentuid="haf5c5e59g1b9ag4198ga266g9af830a0827a" version="1">为了更小的事，我烧得比现在还亮。</content>
	<content contentuid="h1e0ab7d5g5693g4014g8110gdad786529b92" version="1">终于……这光……肯放我走了。</content>
	<content contentuid="hd581c0adg1558g4835g864eg8ae55c15a49f" version="1">桥暗下去了……诸天啊，宽恕他们。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha73c840age828g48e2gbd96gdb59f01b63c2" version="1">我回去……回到造我的那道黎明。</content>
	<content contentuid="h291a9667gdbacg4003g858dgd6e9fccdeb95" version="1">盯着那个大的打？真可爱。这儿的麻烦是我。</content>
	<content contentuid="h0b2e92fagf30ag412cg9121gd34c32c5606e" version="1">背对我。来啊。我看你敢不敢。</content>
	<content contentuid="h11ec1d8eg909cg482bg8fbagfc268e138e0a" version="1">酒馆醉汉的步子都比你利索。呵欠。</content>
	<content contentuid="h09ebb47cg199fg4296g9af5ge8dff6ff6ed8" version="1">别往心里去。你的名字我不会记得，脸也不会。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6e58d414g7a46g4239gab68ge45e60a538a0" version="1">这下看见我了。真可爱。再来。</content>
	<content contentuid="h3a2b4c9fge3fcg4788gbca7g2b6d25e4d57b" version="1">打偏了。不过，这份劲头，赐福给你。</content>
	<content contentuid="h7e08c9e4ge9dag475eg80f5g4577c56ddd29" version="1">你到底打不打？连风都腻了。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb6775665g2b5eg484egb036gd924bb7419be" version="1">呵。一道划伤。就这？</content>
	<content contentuid="hbab56ff5g8448g4d0fg807dgde69d8397922" version="1">这下有点意思了。也只是一点。</content>
	<content contentuid="hd05adef2g9d9fg4275gaa4bge6def0418bca" version="1">困得住我，你就困。谁都试过。谁都落空。</content>
	<content contentuid="h6e6f0094g58efg4056gb7f1ga89e33f0dd6b" version="1">到底……还是困住了。风总会……再找一条路。</content>
	<content contentuid="ha93af976gceb2g4b25g960cg35a547590719" version="1">这单契约……做到头了。</content>
	<content contentuid="hba0bdbd8g44e9g4d7aga7e5g1af57bf6cfa5" version="1">安静了……终于。</content>
	<content contentuid="hd8b8d996gd048g4f27g84fbg6e0e1073e89a" version="1">呜哈！重骑兵到了，伊斯提克！</content>
	<content contentuid="haa1295b4g55a4g45afg8115g8ba4f71831c5" version="1">好了伙计们，准备开心了吗？</content>
	<content contentuid="h6d20da43gda42g4f33g8d97gb5baa8a3554e" version="1">什么？！球棒我上次才擦干净！</content>
	<content contentuid="hfc76a806g83feg4079g92ddg84d9afa68f49" version="1">嘿，看看这是谁！又是一群伊斯提克！哈！</content>
	<content contentuid="h11f4af7fg0460g4755g8b6egac73c28eb51e" version="1">啊啊啊！赫塔卡！</content>
	<content contentuid="hdc0bc9b8gf65ag412egba91g16a061f1820a" version="1">什卡斯·扎伊——为了弗拉基丝！</content>
	<content contentuid="h1115c119g7919g419cg93b3g18a6932370d3" version="1">哈哈，克恰奇，人已经不在了！</content>
	<content contentuid="h6d666336g8990g4360gbc12gfabc53785d0b" version="1">赫塔齐斯！背信者，死！</content>
	<content contentuid="h780489d9g2bbcg498eg8b5cga3f51f0a573a" version="1">稳住，卡维尔，稳住……</content>
	<content contentuid="h17420d6eg7a1ag4621g9244g1cb79f221c8f" version="1">就这，伊斯提克？！</content>
	<content contentuid="h6d40970eg04d2g4747g8100g4e708ee00c2b" version="1">笑啊，伊斯提克——我回头照样踢你！</content>
	<content contentuid="h13de297egb9f0g4c84g82afge9ac78682bca" version="1">这是什么东西，茨克瓦？！坎查！</content>
	<content contentuid="h5a1daae6gaaabg49abg88e4ga2d8abb38aa1" version="1">弗拉基丝……什卡斯·扎伊……记住我……卡维尔……白银的那个……</content>
	<content contentuid="h110f9a6dg078cg4616ga4beg8cd82ada62a5" version="1">……还没完。黑暗者一直跟着我……</content>
	<content contentuid="h13453e08g8cb4g40d1ga184ge82848f0dc6f" version="1">茨克瓦……松手吧……</content>
	<content contentuid="h004e82e7ga42ag4260gb7dagfb2e0333693e" version="1">啊——</content>
</contentList>
